      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WINGED RUPEE (2) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fifth (20.04) in a Grade 5 at this track. Still to record a win from this draw but has never missed the frame in two starts. Looks the one to beat on his best form. HELLO ASHBY (8) broke well and quickly mustered speed to win over the 365m at Nowra two runs back then prominent throughout when finishing second at Nowra last start. Strong form has emerged from her last run. Will give a great sight again. ROSCOE CONKLIN (1) turned spotting a big start finishing seventh (22.96) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. Boasts two wins from three starts out of this box. Expected to give a good account. HOODWINKED (7) must be respected at his pet distance.",
